   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "You are in charge of programming for a music festival. The festival has a main stage, a secondary stage, and several smaller stages. There are 40 bands confirmed for the festival. Five of those will play the main stage, and 8 will play the secondary stage. How many ways are there for you to allocate bands to these 2 stages?",
